l</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"140b30594fbd26d8\" href=\"?note=140b30594fbd26d8\" title=\"57-df-first-order-language\">57-df-first-order-language</a> 的字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Card}(\\kappa)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a7a345348b1a1d3a\" href=\"?note=a7a345348b1a1d3a\" title=\"57-df-cardinal\">57-df-cardinal</a>。量化结构均属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\">\\(\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\\)</span> 是载体的基数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ls\\text{-}uncountable}\\vdash\n\\left[\\kappa\\ge\\max(\\aleph_0,|S|,|T|)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak B\\models T\\land\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|\\ge\\aleph_0)\\right]\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models T\\land\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|=\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ls\\text{-}uncountable}\\vdash\n\\left[\\kappa\\ge\\max(\\aleph_0,|S|,|T|)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak B\\models T\\land\\bigl||\\mathfrak B|\\bigr|\\ge\\aleph_0)\\right]\\to\n\\exists\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\;(\\mathfrak A\\models T\\land\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|=\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 